WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.100
-Okay, so, last night,
two things happened.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.167
I was a guest on "The
Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon"

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.801
and Jimmy had his
fantasy-football draft.

00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:09.234
He was drafting against
the staff.

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:10.701
He asked me for some tips.

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:12.934
-I have no idea what I'm doing.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.167
-Okay. I can help.
This is what I do.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.701
-Yeah.
-We're colleagues now.

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:18.234
-Yeah.
-You can e-mail me.

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:19.968
-I can?
-I'll get my number to you.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:22.267
You'll text me. Yeah.
Wait. 'Cause, listen.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.067
You have pick 2 this year.
-I have pick 2. That's big deal.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.567
-Right. So, most likely,
Jonathan Taylor will go 1.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.634
He's the Colts' running back,
had a great season last year.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.868
So, my question to you is,
what kind of player are you?

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.834
Like, do you want to be
risk-averse

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.501
or are you gonna
swing for the fences?

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.067
Because I'm a believer in,
you know,

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.567
Ricky Bobby from
"Talladega Nights."

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:40.334
Like, if you ain't first,
you're last, right?

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:42.300
If I were you, at pick 2,
I'm taking Christian McCaffrey,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.067
who's been hurt
the last two years,

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.200
but, when he is healthy,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.968
has been the best player
in fantasy football.

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.501
So, again,
it's a risk/reward pick.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:50.501
That's what I would do at 2.

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:51.634
That's who I have
ranked number 2.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:53.200
By the way, do you want to win?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.033
I mean, like, you can --
Because, like, yeah,

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.067
I mean, if you want to,
I will help you

00:00:58.067 --> 00:00:59.834
crush your staff like a grape.

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:01.367
You know...

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:04.100
I gave him a couple of hints,
and then he sent me his draft

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.534
and said,
"Hey, grade it for me."

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:07.367
So, okay, Jimmy, here it goes.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:08.534
I love your quarterback.

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.667
Lamar Jackson's gonna have
a monster season

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.334
as he chases that new contract.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.567
You have Travis Kelce,
who I have as

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:16.334
the number-1 tight end
in fantasy.

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:19.234
Great. Your running backs --
you went with "CMC" at 2.

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:21.000
So, I love McCaffrey this year.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.234
Plus, Ezekiel Elliott,
Elijah Mitchell, Antonio Gibson.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:24.834
You have
four starting running backs.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.400
Great depth there.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.234
My concern is
your wide receivers.

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:30.367
A.J. Brown is more of
a number-2 wide receiver

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.067
than the number 1
that you have him as,

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.734
and I'm concerned about
Jaylen Waddle

00:01:33.734 --> 00:01:36.467
and a new situation in Miami
with a lot more targets

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:39.834
to go around to guys like
Tyreek Hill and Chase Edmonds.

00:01:39.834 --> 00:01:42.167
Ultimately, I give you a B-plus.
[ Ding ]

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:43.601
But here's the great news.

00:01:43.601 --> 00:01:46.701
Wide receiver is the deepest
position in fantasy football,

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:48.767
so you and I -- we're gonna
work the waiver wire,

00:01:48.767 --> 00:01:51.267
We're gonna upgrade
that wide-receiver position,

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.734
and we're gonna
bring home the title

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:55.133
as you crush your league
like a grape.

